<title>USA: USDA offers Latvia $6 mln under GSM-102 for FY97.</title>
<headline>USDA offers Latvia $6 mln under GSM-102 for FY97.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday it authorized $6 million in credit guarantees for sales of U.S. farm goods to Latvia under the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102) for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said the commodities covered include cotton, hides, breeder livestock, meat, wheat, feed grains and vegetable oil.</p>
